		{ "Your PlayStation Network account", "Tu cuenta de PlayStation Network" },
		{ "The console only accepts the account signed in on it. Mac'n'Play needs its identifier, which it gets by connecting to PSN.", "La consola solo acepta la cuenta con la que se ha iniciado sesión en ella. Mac'n'Play necesita su identificador, que obtiene al conectarse a PSN." },
